ts.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_Bibliophile_AdviceForWriters</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_Bibliophile_AdviceForWriters\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_Bibliophile_AdviceForWriters\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">26ebaa16-2074-4231-bbda-6ad4e74c7b3a</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:26ebaa16-2074-4231-bbda-6ad4e74c7b3a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:26ebaa16-2074-4231-bbda-6ad4e74c7b3a\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the mailbox of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Bibliophile\" title=\"The Bibliophile\">The Bibliophile</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-112&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-122</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>My friend, tragedy has struck! Remember the invitation you wrangled for me, to visit Volo's salon?\n</p><p><br>\nThe moment I saw him, I couldn't help but fall to my knees, speechless before such a great man. As I babbled like a fool, all of his writerly friends poked jibes at me, until I felt forced to flee for shame!\n</p><p><br>\nNow all of the literary Gate is mocking me, before I've even published a single story! I fear no one shall ever publish me now.\n</p><p><br>\nWhatever should I do?\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>See also:\n<ul><li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rare_book_request\" title=\"Rare book request\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rare_book_request\" title=\"Rare book request\">Rare book request</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202304\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.062 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.065 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1714/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27912/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7525/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion dep